{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Beyond Enemy Lines - Vietnam is a tactical first person shooter set in the Vietnam War!</strong></h2><br>You are onboard of a helicopter on the way back to HQ after a top secret mission. Your helicopter gets hit by aan vietnamese RPG and crashes into the vietnamese jungle - you are the only survivor! Your task is to survive and find a way to HQ and deliver your captured informations.<br><br>You have total freedom to choose your path - guns blazing or silent assassin - it's your choice! Beyond Enemy Lines - Vietnam is an unforgiving, intense experience where skill and tactical decisions matter!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Nonlinear Story Campaign<br></li><li> <strong>Detailed Weapon Customization</strong><br></li><li> Unlock new weapons and weapon attachements for <strong>New Game +</strong><br></li><li> <strong>Variete of controllable vehicles</strong><br></li><li> 100% Combat Sandbox, you are free to approach you every mission objective in your way!<br></li><li> Different mission areas from jungle to villages and cities<br></li><li> Detailed mission rating system<br></li><li> From the ground up reengineered AI<br></li><li> Unreal Engine 5 and full Lumen Reflection and Global Illumination support<br></li><li> And more to be revealed ..</li></ul><br>Find out more details and features in the coming months. Make sure to Wishlist <strong>Beyond Enemy Lines - Vietnam</strong> and Follow us on social media!","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1467270?t=1749472635","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1467270/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749472635","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1467270/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749472635","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1467270/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749472635","categories":[{